<control id="u1cff658a-1011" class="AppControlSidecar" script="u1cff658a-1011"><graphic language=""><text text="The Cisco ASR 1013 Router has two power zones: Power zone 1(top half of chassis) includes slots: PS1-A PS1-B Carrier card slots 3, 4, and 5 RP1 FP1 Power zone 0 (bottom half of chassis) includes slots: PS0-A PS0-B Carrier card slots 0, 1, and 2 RP0 FP0 " html="html"><![CDATA[The Cisco ASR 1013 Router has two power zones:<br><span class='Bullet'>Power zone 1(top half of chassis) includes slots:</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>PS1-A</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>PS1-B</span><br><span class='Bullet'> Carrier card slots 3, 4, and 5</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>RP1</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>FP1</span><br><span class='Bullet'>Power zone 0 (bottom half of chassis) includes slots:</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>PS0-A</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>PS0-B</span><br><span class='Bullet'>Carrier card slots 0, 1, and 2</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>RP0</span><br><span class='Bullet2'>FP0</span>]]></text><field name="titleText" value="Rear View"/><field name="tipText" value="Show"/></graphic>
