<control id="u1d9d52da-1003" class="AppControlSection"><graphic language=""><text text="The Cisco ASR 1013 Router offers highly integrated services for enterprise and service provider networks. With 200 Gbps total system bandwidth and up to 130 Mpps packet-forwarding capabilities, this powerful edge device delivers exceptional performance for its price range." html="html"><![CDATA[The Cisco ASR 1013 Router offers highly integrated services for enterprise and service provider networks. With 200 Gbps total system bandwidth and up to 130 Mpps packet-forwarding capabilities, this powerful edge device delivers exceptional performance for its price range.]]></text><field name="section" value="Product Overview"/></graphic>
